WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Truth Archive Bureau: The Kanshan Disappearance — an AI-driven deduction game.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Investigate a disappearance through open conversations and evidence.

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Eight characters, ten ending tiers, and four information-manipulation mechanisms.

4
00:00:44.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Solo and 2–5-player modes, with a script-production workspace.

5
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Independently developed in 48 hours for the Zhihu Hackathon. Participation is recorded separately from awards.
